---
---

<section class="about section" id="sobre-mi">
	<div class="container">
		<h2>Your technology partner to turn ideas into functional software</h2>
		<div class="about-content">
			<div class="about-text">
				<p class="lead">
					I'm Carlos, a Systems Engineer with a passion for solving complex problems through code. Over the past 4 years, I've worked developing quality software for companies and organizations seeking robust and scalable technological solutions.
				</p>
				<p>
					My experience in backend development with Python, Django, C#, and .NET, combined with my ability to create mobile applications with Flutter, allows me to build complete systems that not only work flawlessly but generate real value and measurable results.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="about-features">
				<div class="feature-card">
					<div class="feature-icon">
						<img src="https://api.iconify.design/mdi/rocket-launch.svg?color=%233b82f6" alt="Full-stack Development" />
					</div>
					<h3>Complete full-stack development</h3>
					<p>From user interface to backend infrastructure</p>
				</div>
				<div class="feature-card">
					<div class="feature-icon">
						<img src="https://api.iconify.design/mdi/chat-processing.svg?color=%233b82f6" alt="Clear Communication" />
					</div>
					<h3>Clear communication</h3>
					<p>Constant updates throughout the project</p>
				</div>
				<div class="feature-card">
					<div class="feature-icon">
						<img src="https://api.iconify.design/mdi/code-braces-box.svg?color=%233b82f6" alt="Clean Code" />
					</div>
					<h3>Clean and scalable code</h3>
					<p>Easy to maintain and ready to grow</p>
				</div>
				<div class="feature-card">
					<div class="feature-icon">
						<img src="https://api.iconify.design/mdi/shield-check.svg?color=%233b82f6" alt="Quality Commitment" />
					</div>
					<h3>Commitment to quality</h3>
					<p>Respect for deadlines and professional standards</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.about {
		background-color: white;
	}

	.about h2 {
		text-align: center;
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto 3rem;
	}

	.about-content {
		display: grid;
		gap: 4rem;
	}

	.about-text {
		max-width: 900px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.lead {
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
		color: var(--color-text);
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.about-text p {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
	}

	.about-features {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
		gap: 2rem;
		margin-top: 2rem;
	}

	.feature-card {
		padding: 2rem;
		background: var(--color-bg-alt);
		border-radius: 12px;
		transition: all 0.3s ease;
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
	}

	.feature-card:hover {
		transform: translateY(-5px);
		box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
		border-color: var(--color-primary);
	}

	.feature-icon {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		align-items: center;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.feature-icon img {
		width: 56px;
		height: 56px;
		object-fit: contain;
	}

	.feature-card h3 {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		color: var(--color-text);
	}

	.feature-card p {
		color: var(--color-text-light);
		margin: 0;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.about-features {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.feature-card {
			text-align: center;
		}
	}
</style>
